              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a multiRecordWidget with columns: \"Name\", \"Buyer Role\", \"Job Title\", \"Recent Engagement Date\", \"Activity\" based on {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_CONTACT_ENGAGEMENT.$output}}.\n\n\"Name\" -> contactName, \n\"Buyer Role\" -> buyerRole, \n\"Job Title\" -> contactTitle, \n\"Recent Engagement Date\" - <Get the data part with out the time part from engagementDate. For example, 2026-01-25T12:37:47.383Z should represent as 2026-01-25> \n\"Activity\" -> activity\n\nWhen generating the response, do not use ALL CAPS for words, sentences, headings, or labels.\nUse normal sentence case or title case only.\nAvoid fully capitalized words unless they are part of a proper noun that is normally written in uppercase.\n\nReturn only the top 5 rows.\n\nDo not generate the widget title and widget description"
            }
